/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (This report presents an implementation-based comparison of Minimum Spanning Tree \(MST\) and Shortest Path graph optimization. Q39 requires a graph to be used to compute an MST and a shortest path, compare objectives and outputs, analyze greedy selection strategies, evaluate complexity, discuss applications, and generate graph- optimization insights. The supplied implementation uses Kruskal's algorithm for the MST and Dijkstra's algorithm for the shortest path.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
